# React/Tauri frontend — its own git repo, wired in as a SUBMODULE (2026-08-14).
# It used to be ignored outright, which meant a clone of this repo contained no
# OpenCohost_UI directory at all while every document said `cd OpenCohost_UI &&
# pnpm tauri:debug`. Nobody hit it because only the owner had ever cloned this.
# Do NOT re-add an ignore rule here: the submodule entry in .gitmodules is what
# carries the frontend now, and an ignore rule would silently shadow it.

# Runtime user config (contains api_tokens.json — secrets must never land in git).
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `config/` also swallowed the tracked
# opencohost/config/ package (new source files there became invisible to git).
/config/
.pnpm-store/

